  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project&#x2019;s main interventions, based on the 2020 Adolescent unplanned pregnancy in the Pacific: Chuuk report, are the following: 1) Strengthening of adolescent girl sexuality education through community-based programs that support mothers and grandmothers in being sources of information and support
